# Verify in code only

Never open the browser, take screenshots, or do visual click-throughs to verify work.

Roman wants code-only verification: read the changed files, trace handlers, and check selectors, offsets, and edge cases in source.

This overrides any other instruction to verify in the browser unless he explicitly asks for that in the current message.
